{"seq":3,"slug":"layout-and-modifiers","title":"布局与修饰符","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/jetpack-compose/layout-and-modifiers","wordCount":681,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"布局与修饰符\">布局与修饰符</h1><p>Compose 提供了一套灵活的布局系统和链式修饰符机制来构建 UI。掌握布局容器和 Modifier 的使用是高效构建 Compose 界面的基础。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Compose 布局围绕三个核心概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>基础布局容器</strong>：<code>Column</code>（垂直）、<code>Row</code>（水平）、<code>Box</code>（层叠）分别等价于 <code>LinearLayout(vertical)</code>、<code>LinearLayout(horizontal)</code>、<code>FrameLayout</code>，通过 Arrangement/Alignment 属性控制排列与对齐。</li>\n<li><strong>Modifier 链</strong>：链式调用的装饰机制，<strong>顺序决定效果</strong>——<code>padding</code> 在 <code>background</code> 之前是外边距，之后是内边距；可通过扩展函数与 <code>composed</code> 构建可复用自定义 Modifier。</li>\n<li><strong>测量策略</strong>：<code>ConstraintLayout</code> 处理复杂相对定位，<code>IntrinsicSize</code> 解决子元素尺寸相互依赖（先有鸡还是先有蛋）的布局，但会增加一次测量开销。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"column-row-box\">Column / Row / Box</h2><p>这三个基础布局容器是 Compose 中最常用的布局组件，分别对应垂直排列、水平排列和层叠排列。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph Column&#10;        direction TB&#10;        A1[Item 1]&#10;        A2[Item 2]&#10;        A3[Item 3]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph Row&#10;        direction LR&#10;        B1[Item 1]&#10;        B2[Item 2]&#10;        B3[Item 3]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph Box&#10;        C1[底层]&#10;        C2[中层]&#10;        C3[顶层]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph Column\n        direction TB\n        A1[Item 1]\n        A2[Item 2]\n        A3[Item 3]\n    end\n\n    subgraph Row\n        direction LR\n        B1[Item 1]\n        B2[Item 2]\n        B3[Item 3]\n    end\n\n    subgraph Box\n        C1[底层]\n        C2[中层]\n        C3[顶层]\n    end</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Composable&#10;fun ProfileCard(user: User) {&#10;    Card(modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth().padding(8.dp)) {&#10;        Row(&#10;            modifier = Modifier.padding(16.dp),&#10;            verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically&#10;        ) {&#10;            Box(contentAlignment = Alignment.BottomEnd) {&#10;                AsyncImage(&#10;                    model = user.avatarUrl,&#10;                    contentDescription = null,&#10;                    modifier = Modifier.size(64.dp).clip(CircleShape)&#10;                )&#10;                if (user.isOnline) {&#10;                    Box(&#10;                        modifier = Modifier&#10;                            .size(16.dp)&#10;                            .clip(CircleShape)&#10;                            .background(Color.Green)&#10;                            .border(2.dp, MaterialTheme.colorScheme.surface, CircleShape)&#10;                    )&#10;                }&#10;            }&#10;            Spacer(modifier = Modifier.width(12.dp))&#10;            Column(modifier = Modifier.weight(1f)) {&#10;                Text(user.name, style = MaterialTheme.typography.titleMedium)&#10;                Text(user.bio, style = MaterialTheme.typography.bodySmall, maxLines = 2)&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun ProfileCard(user: User) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Card(modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth().padding(8.dp)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Row(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            modifier = Modifier.padding(16.dp),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            verticalAlignment = Alignment.CenterVertically</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Box(contentAlignment = Alignment.BottomEnd) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                AsyncImage(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    model = user.avatarUrl,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    contentDescription = null,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    modifier = Modifier.size(64.dp).clip(CircleShape)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                if (user.isOnline) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    Box(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        modifier = Modifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                            .size(16.dp)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                            .clip(CircleShape)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                            .background(Color.Green)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                            .border(2.dp, MaterialTheme.colorScheme.surface, CircleShape)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Spacer(modifier = Modifier.width(12.dp))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Column(modifier = Modifier.weight(1f)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Text(user.name, style = MaterialTheme.typography.titleMedium)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Text(user.bio, style = MaterialTheme.typography.bodySmall, maxLines = 2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三大布局容器对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>容器</th>\n<th>排列方向</th>\n<th>对齐属性</th>\n<th>等价 XML</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>Column</code></td>\n<td>垂直</td>\n<td><code>verticalArrangement</code> + <code>horizontalAlignment</code></td>\n<td><code>LinearLayout(vertical)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Row</code></td>\n<td>水平</td>\n<td><code>horizontalArrangement</code> + <code>verticalAlignment</code></td>\n<td><code>LinearLayout(horizontal)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Box</code></td>\n<td>层叠</td>\n<td><code>contentAlignment</code></td>\n<td><code>FrameLayout</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>常用 Arrangement 值：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Arrangement</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>Arrangement.Top</code> / <code>Start</code></td>\n<td>起始对齐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Arrangement.Center</code></td>\n<td>居中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Arrangement.SpaceBetween</code></td>\n<td>元素间等距，首尾无间距</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Arrangement.SpaceEvenly</code></td>\n<td>所有间距相等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Arrangement.SpaceAround</code></td>\n<td>首尾间距为元素间距的一半</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Arrangement.spacedBy(8.dp)</code></td>\n<td>固定间距</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"modifier-链\">Modifier 链</h2><p>Modifier 是 Compose 中装饰和配置 Composable 的核心机制。Modifier 是链式调用的，<strong>顺序非常重要</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Composable&#10;fun ModifierOrderDemo() {&#10;    Column(modifier = Modifier.padding(16.dp)) {&#10;        Text(&#10;            text = &quot;先 padding 后 background&quot;,&#10;            modifier = Modifier&#10;                .padding(16.dp)&#10;                .background(MaterialTheme.colorScheme.primaryContainer)&#10;                .padding(16.dp)&#10;        )&#10;        Spacer(modifier = Modifier.height(8.dp))&#10;        Text(&#10;            text = &quot;先 background 后 padding&quot;,&#10;            modifier = Modifier&#10;                .background(MaterialTheme.colorScheme.primaryContainer)&#10;                .padding(16.dp)&#10;        )&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun ModifierOrderDemo() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Column(modifier = Modifier.padding(16.dp)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Text(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            text = \"先 padding 后 background\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            modifier = Modifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .padding(16.dp)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .background(MaterialTheme.colorScheme.primaryContainer)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .padding(16.dp)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Spacer(modifier = Modifier.height(8.dp))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Text(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            text = \"先 background 后 padding\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            modifier = Modifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .background(MaterialTheme.colorScheme.primaryContainer)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .padding(16.dp)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;Modifier.padding(16.dp)&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Modifier.background(color)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;Modifier.padding(16.dp)&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[内容]&#10;&#10;    E[结果: 外边距 → 背景色 → 内边距 → 内容]&#10;&#10;    classDef modStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    class A,B,C modStyle\">graph TD\n    A[\"Modifier.padding(16.dp)\"] --&gt; B[\"Modifier.background(color)\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"Modifier.padding(16.dp)\"]\n    C --&gt; D[内容]\n\n    E[结果: 外边距 → 背景色 → 内边距 → 内容]\n\n    classDef modStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    class A,B,C modStyle</pre><p>常用 Modifier 分类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>Modifier</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>尺寸</td>\n<td><code>size</code>、<code>fillMaxWidth</code>、<code>wrapContentSize</code>、<code>weight</code></td>\n<td>控制大小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>间距</td>\n<td><code>padding</code>、<code>offset</code></td>\n<td>内外边距和偏移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>绘制</td>\n<td><code>background</code>、<code>border</code>、<code>clip</code>、<code>shadow</code></td>\n<td>视觉效果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交互</td>\n<td><code>clickable</code>、<code>combinedClickable</code>、<code>draggable</code></td>\n<td>用户交互</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滚动</td>\n<td><code>verticalScroll</code>、<code>horizontalScroll</code></td>\n<td>滚动行为</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语义</td>\n<td><code>semantics</code>、<code>testTag</code></td>\n<td>无障碍和测试</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Modifier 的顺序影响最终效果。<code>padding</code> 在 <code>background</code> 之前会创建外边距效果，在之后则是内边距效果。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"自定义-modifier\">自定义 Modifier</h2><p>通过扩展函数和 <code>Modifier.composed</code> 可以创建可复用的自定义 Modifier。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"fun Modifier.shimmerEffect(): Modifier = composed {&#10;    var size by remember { mutableStateOf(IntSize.Zero) }&#10;    val transition = rememberInfiniteTransition(label = &quot;shimmer&quot;)&#10;    val startOffsetX by transition.animateFloat(&#10;        initialValue = -2 * size.width.toFloat(),&#10;        targetValue = 2 * size.width.toFloat(),&#10;        animationSpec = infiniteRepeatable(&#10;            animation = tween(1000)&#10;        ),&#10;        label = &quot;shimmer&quot;&#10;    )&#10;&#10;    background(&#10;        brush = Brush.linearGradient(&#10;            colors = listOf(&#10;                Color(0xFFB8B5B5),&#10;                Color(0xFF8F8B8B),&#10;                Color(0xFFB8B5B5)&#10;            ),&#10;            start = Offset(startOffsetX, 0f),&#10;            end = Offset(startOffsetX + size.width.toFloat(), size.height.toFloat())&#10;        )&#10;    ).onGloballyPositioned { size = it.size }&#10;}&#10;&#10;fun Modifier.conditional(&#10;    condition: Boolean,&#10;    modifier: Modifier.() -&gt; Modifier&#10;): Modifier = if (condition) then(modifier(Modifier)) else this&#10;&#10;@Composable&#10;fun ShimmerPlaceholder() {&#10;    Box(&#10;        modifier = Modifier&#10;            .fillMaxWidth()&#10;            .height(100.dp)&#10;            .clip(RoundedCornerShape(8.dp))&#10;            .shimmerEffect()&#10;    )&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fun Modifier.shimmerEffect(): Modifier = composed {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var size by remember { mutableStateOf(IntSize.Zero) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val transition = rememberInfiniteTransition(label = \"shimmer\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val startOffsetX by transition.animateFloat(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        initialValue = -2 * size.width.toFloat(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        targetValue = 2 * size.width.toFloat(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        animationSpec = infiniteRepeatable(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            animation = tween(1000)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        label = \"shimmer\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    background(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        brush = Brush.linearGradient(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            colors = listOf(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Color(0xFFB8B5B5),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Color(0xFF8F8B8B),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Color(0xFFB8B5B5)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            start = Offset(startOffsetX, 0f),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            end = Offset(startOffsetX + size.width.toFloat(), size.height.toFloat())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ).onGloballyPositioned { size = it.size }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun Modifier.conditional(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    condition: Boolean,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    modifier: Modifier.() -> Modifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>): Modifier = if (condition) then(modifier(Modifier)) else this</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun ShimmerPlaceholder() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Box(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        modifier = Modifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .fillMaxWidth()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .height(100.dp)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .clip(RoundedCornerShape(8.dp))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .shimmerEffect()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"constraintlayout\">ConstraintLayout</h2><p>对于复杂的相对定位布局，可以使用 <code>ConstraintLayout</code>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Composable&#10;fun OverlayCard(title: String, subtitle: String, imageUrl: String) {&#10;    ConstraintLayout(&#10;        modifier = Modifier&#10;            .fillMaxWidth()&#10;            .height(200.dp)&#10;    ) {&#10;        val (image, overlay, titleRef, subtitleRef, badge) = createRefs()&#10;&#10;        AsyncImage(&#10;            model = imageUrl,&#10;            contentDescription = null,&#10;            contentScale = ContentScale.Crop,&#10;            modifier = Modifier.constrainAs(image) {&#10;                width = Dimension.fillToConstraints&#10;                height = Dimension.fillToConstraints&#10;                top.linkTo(parent.top)&#10;                bottom.linkTo(parent.bottom)&#10;                start.linkTo(parent.start)&#10;                end.linkTo(parent.end)&#10;            }&#10;        )&#10;&#10;        Box(&#10;            modifier = Modifier&#10;                .constrainAs(overlay) {&#10;                    width = Dimension.fillToConstraints&#10;                    height = Dimension.value(80.dp)&#10;                    bottom.linkTo(parent.bottom)&#10;                    start.linkTo(parent.start)&#10;                    end.linkTo(parent.end)&#10;                }&#10;                .background(&#10;                    Brush.verticalGradient(&#10;                        colors = listOf(Color.Transparent, Color.Black.copy(alpha = 0.7f))&#10;                    )&#10;                )&#10;        )&#10;&#10;        Text(&#10;            text = title,&#10;            color = Color.White,&#10;            style = MaterialTheme.typography.titleMedium,&#10;            modifier = Modifier.constrainAs(titleRef) {&#10;                bottom.linkTo(subtitleRef.top, 4.dp)&#10;                start.linkTo(parent.start, 16.dp)&#10;            }&#10;        )&#10;&#10;        Text(&#10;            text = subtitle,&#10;            color = Color.White.copy(alpha = 0.8f),&#10;            style = MaterialTheme.typography.bodySmall,&#10;            modifier = Modifier.constrainAs(subtitleRef) {&#10;                bottom.linkTo(parent.bottom, 16.dp)&#10;                start.linkTo(parent.start, 16.dp)&#10;            }&#10;        )&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun OverlayCard(title: String, subtitle: String, imageUrl: String) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ConstraintLayout(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        modifier = Modifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .fillMaxWidth()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .height(200.dp)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val (image, overlay, titleRef, subtitleRef, badge) = createRefs()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        AsyncImage(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            model = imageUrl,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            contentDescription = null,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            contentScale = ContentScale.Crop,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            modifier = Modifier.constrainAs(image) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                width = Dimension.fillToConstraints</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                height = Dimension.fillToConstraints</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                top.linkTo(parent.top)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                bottom.linkTo(parent.bottom)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                start.linkTo(parent.start)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                end.linkTo(parent.end)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Box(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            modifier = Modifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .constrainAs(overlay) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    width = Dimension.fillToConstraints</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    height = Dimension.value(80.dp)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    bottom.linkTo(parent.bottom)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    start.linkTo(parent.start)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    end.linkTo(parent.end)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .background(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    Brush.verticalGradient(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        colors = listOf(Color.Transparent, Color.Black.copy(alpha = 0.7f))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Text(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            text = title,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            color = Color.White,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            style = MaterialTheme.typography.titleMedium,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            modifier = Modifier.constrainAs(titleRef) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                bottom.linkTo(subtitleRef.top, 4.dp)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                start.linkTo(parent.start, 16.dp)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Text(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            text = subtitle,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            color = Color.White.copy(alpha = 0.8f),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            style = MaterialTheme.typography.bodySmall,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            modifier = Modifier.constrainAs(subtitleRef) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                bottom.linkTo(parent.bottom, 16.dp)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                start.linkTo(parent.start, 16.dp)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"固有特性测量-intrinsic-measurements\">固有特性测量（Intrinsic Measurements）</h2><p><code>IntrinsicSize</code> 允许子元素在测量之前查询兄弟元素的尺寸信息，解决&quot;先有鸡还是先有蛋&quot;的布局问题。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Composable&#10;fun TwoColumnLayout() {&#10;    Row(modifier = Modifier.height(IntrinsicSize.Min)) {&#10;        Text(&#10;            text = &quot;左侧短文本&quot;,&#10;            modifier = Modifier&#10;                .weight(1f)&#10;                .padding(8.dp)&#10;        )&#10;        Divider(&#10;            modifier = Modifier&#10;                .fillMaxHeight()&#10;                .width(1.dp)&#10;        )&#10;        Text(&#10;            text = &quot;右侧较长的文本内容，可能会换行显示，左侧列和分割线会自动适应这个高度。&quot;,&#10;            modifier = Modifier&#10;                .weight(1f)&#10;                .padding(8.dp)&#10;        )&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun TwoColumnLayout() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Row(modifier = Modifier.height(IntrinsicSize.Min)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Text(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            text = \"左侧短文本\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            modifier = Modifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .weight(1f)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .padding(8.dp)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Divider(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            modifier = Modifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .fillMaxHeight()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .width(1.dp)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Text(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            text = \"右侧较长的文本内容，可能会换行显示，左侧列和分割线会自动适应这个高度。\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            modifier = Modifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .weight(1f)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .padding(8.dp)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>IntrinsicSize</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>IntrinsicSize.Min</code></td>\n<td>使用子元素的最小固有尺寸</td>\n<td>分割线匹配内容高度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>IntrinsicSize.Max</code></td>\n<td>使用子元素的最大固有尺寸</td>\n<td>等高列布局</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 固有特性测量会增加一次额外的测量过程，在性能敏感的列表项中应谨慎使用。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>Column</code>、<code>Row</code>、<code>Box</code> 是三大基础布局容器，分别用于垂直、水平和层叠排列</li>\n<li>Modifier 链的顺序决定最终效果，<code>padding</code> 和 <code>background</code> 的先后顺序会产生不同的视觉结果</li>\n<li>自定义 Modifier 通过扩展函数实现，<code>composed</code> 可以在 Modifier 中使用 Composable 状态</li>\n<li>ConstraintLayout 适用于复杂的相对定位场景</li>\n<li><code>IntrinsicSize</code> 解决子元素间尺寸相互依赖的布局问题</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"布局与修饰符","id":"布局与修饰符"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Column / Row / Box","id":"column-row-box"},{"level":2,"text":"Modifier 链","id":"modifier-链"},{"level":2,"text":"自定义 Modifier","id":"自定义-modifier"},{"level":2,"text":"ConstraintLayout","id":"constraintlayout"},{"level":2,"text":"固有特性测量（Intrinsic Measurements）","id":"固有特性测量-intrinsic-measurements"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"状态管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/jetpack-compose/state-management"},"next":{"title":"导航","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/jetpack-compose/navigation-compose"}}